# BUG-011 — Cart Icon Incorrectly Positioned Across Multiple Pages

## Summary

When logged in as `visual_user`, the Shopping Cart icon is incorrectly positioned across multiple pages of the application.

## Environment

| Item | Details |
|------|---------|
| Application | SauceDemo Web Application |
| User | visual_user |
| Browser | Google Chrome |
| Operating System | Windows 11 |
| Test Type | Visual / UI Testing |

## Preconditions

- User is logged in as `visual_user`.

## Steps to Reproduce

1. Log in using `visual_user`.
2. Navigate through the Products page.
3. Open a Product Details page.
4. Open the Shopping Cart.
5. Observe the position of the Shopping Cart icon on each page.

## Expected Result

The Shopping Cart icon should remain correctly positioned and consistently aligned with the application header/navigation across all pages.

## Actual Result

The Shopping Cart icon is incorrectly positioned across multiple pages.

